        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Directions",
            "icon": "washing",
            "content": "<p>Pump lotion into palm. Dab a small amount onto the tip of your first two fingers. </p><p>Gently massage onto face or desired body part using upward and inward motions. </p><p>Product goes on white but will disappear as you massage it into your skin.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "plant",
            "content": "<p>Aloe barbadensis (aloe vera) juice, persea gratissima (avocado) oil, cetearyl alcohol, cetyl alcohol, stearic acid, glyceryl<br/>stearate, vegetable glycerin, althea officinalis (marsh mallow) root extract,<br/>cucumis sativus (cucumber) fruit extract, phyllostachis bambusoides (bamboo)<br/>rhizome extract, polysorbate 20 (food-grade, phenoxyethanol, caprylyl glycol</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Scent",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "content": "<p>Nourish Botanicals’ scents are made with Pure Essential Oils that are hand selected by us from small farms all around the world.<br/>  </p><h3>Cottage Garden</h3><p><br/>Pure essential oils of lavender, sage, and rosemary come together in this serene, herbaceous blend. Soft floral notes calm the spirit, while crisp greens and bright aromatics bring freshness and vitality. Gentle and grounding, Cottage Garden transforms everyday care into a peaceful retreat.<br/>    </p><p><strong>Scent Ingredients:</strong><br/>Lavandula Angustifolia (Lavender) Oil,        Salvia Officinalis (Sage) Oil,      Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Oil, Linalool & Limonene (natural components of essential oils)<br/>    </p><h3>Viridian Grove</h3><p><br/>Viridian Grove is a sophisticated fusion of pure essential oils, refreshing the body and centering the mind. Bright bergamot uplifts with clean energy, cedarwood lends a warm, woody depth, and sage offers herbal clarity. Crisp yet grounding, it restores balance and connection to nature.<br/>    </p><p><strong>Scent Ingredients:</strong><br/>Citrus Bergamia (Bergamot) Fruit Oil,       Cedrus Atlantica (Cedarwood) Oil,       Salvia Officinalis (Sage) Oil, Limonene & Linalool (natural components of essential oils)<br/>    </p><h3>Unscented</h3><p>Contains no added scent</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_ePhpLz": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredient Descriptions",
            "icon": "eye",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/unlock-the-soothing-power-of-aloe-vera-leaf-juice-for-hair-and-skin-your-ultimate-guide\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Unlock the Soothing Power of Aloe Vera Leaf Juice for Hair and Skin: Your Ultimate Guide\"><strong>Aloe Barbadensis (Aloe) Leaf Juice</strong></a> (base hydrator),</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/news/your-ultimate-guide-to-food-grade-cold-pressed-avocado-oil\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Your Ultimate Guide to Food Grade, Cold Pressed Avocado Oil\"><strong>Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil </strong></a>(deep hydration),</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-cetearyl-alcohol-and-what-does-it-do-in-hair-and-skin-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Cetearyl Alcohol and what does it do in hair and skin products?\"><strong>Cetearyl Alcohol</strong></a> (plant-derived, softens),</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-cetyl-alcohol-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Cetyl Alcohol and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Cetyl Alcohol </strong></a>(plant-based, adds satin feel),</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-stearic-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Stearic Acid and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Stearic Acid</strong></a> (plant-based skin softener),</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-glyceryl-stearate-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Glyceryl Stearate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Glyceryl Stearate</strong></a> (plant-based, smooths & softens),</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-glycerin-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Glycerin and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Glycerin</strong></a> (hydrates & softens),</p><p><strong>Althea Officinalis (Marshmallow) Root Extract </strong>(helps soothe<br/>skin),</p><p><strong>Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Fruit Extract</strong> (helps hydrate<br/>skin),</p><p><strong>Bambusa Vulgaris (Bamboo) Extract</strong> (soothes & hydrates),</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-food-grade-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Food-Grade Polysorbate 20 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong></a> [food-grade] (plant-based oil emulsifier),</p><p><strong>Caprylyl Glycol</strong> (plant-based formula support),</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a> (gentle preserver)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-are-essential-oils\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What are Essential Oils?\"><strong>Essential Oils </strong></a>(scent, if scented)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_DAQEEi": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does Nourish Botanicals compare to Rustic Strength's main line of products?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p>Both Nourish Botanicals and Rustic Strength are clean and transparent. Rustic Strength offers accessible, high-purity everyday essentials. Nourish is our elevated line—it replaces water with aloe vera juice and layers premium botanical extracts, crafted in small batches for no-compromise, aloe-led performance.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_eetcjp": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does this product come with a pump?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p>We do not automatically provide a pump or spout with our products because our goal is to reduce waste.</p><p>If you would like a pump or spout, we offer options as an add-on in our accessory section. </p><ul><li><a href=\"/products/1-gallon-glass-or-plastic-container-pump\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pump | fits 1 Gallon Glass or Plastic Jug\">Gallon (Glass or Plastic) Jug Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/how-to-assemble-the-wide-mouth-jar-pump\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Wide-Mouth Jar Pump Help\">1 Gallon Wide Mouth Jar Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/eco-jug-help\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Eco-Jug Help\">Eco Jug Accessories</a></li><li><a href=\"/products/bucket-dispenser-pump-5-gallon\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Bucket Pump | fits 5 Gallon Bucket\">Bucket Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/collections/drum-pumps\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"drum pumps\">Drum Pumps</a></li></ul><p><strong>Retail Ready Case (2 oz, 4 oz & 16 oz) : </strong>Retail Ready products come as shown in the case image. Pump, Sprayer or Flip-Top Cap is included if shown.</p><p>No pump is available for the <strong>24 oz Glass Jug</strong>. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
